<title>NEW ZEALAND: Timberwest to sell private timberlands - FCL Canada.</title>
<headline>Timberwest to sell private timberlands - FCL Canada.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fletcher Challenge Canada said on Friday that its 52 percent-owned Timberwest Forest Ltd would sell its private timberlands into the capital market by way of a timberland income fund and distribute the net cash proceeds to shareholders.  </p>
<p>TimberWest would continue as a publicly listed company, retaining ownership of its remaining coastal and interior operations.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 473-4746</p>
</text>
